WEBVTT

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:02.377
[woman on radio] <i>Traffic is at 50 miles</i>

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.171
<i>according to the São Paulo
traffic company,</i>

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:09.967
<i>But our monitoring shows that we have
300 miles of blocked ways.</i>

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:12.387
[radio jingle plays]

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:14.473
<i>[woman on radio] If you're in the west,</i>

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.140
<i>do not go to Marginal Pinheiros</i>

00:00:16.237 --> 00:00:20.878
<i>because there is a demonstration
blocking all lanes, so be careful with…</i>

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:24.023
[man 1] <i>It comes down
to individual character.</i>

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:25.233
<i>It's about free will.</i>

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:29.734
<i>The thing is: if you think you're going
to get caught, you don't commit a crime.</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.074
<i>When you go to a strict country,
that has a strict law system,</i>

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:35.807
<i>a muslim or totalitarian country,</i>

00:00:35.891 --> 00:00:37.356
<i>where they cut off your hands,</i>

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.274
-[man 1] <i>crime drops.</i>
-[man 2] <i>No one wants to live there.</i>

00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:42.209
-[man 1] <i>That's not it.</i>
-[man 2] <i>It is.</i>

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.328
-[man 1] <i>Manslaughter rates are at 5%.</i>
-[man 2] <i>No, wait.</i>

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.881
[man 1] <i>The guy has to kill
20 people to go to jail.</i>

00:00:47.989 --> 00:00:50.902
<i>♪ When all the world's asleep ♪</i>

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:55.347
<i>♪ The questions run too deep ♪</i>

00:00:56.097 --> 00:01:01.334
<i>♪ For such a simple man ♪</i>

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:07.327
<i>♪ Won't you please
please tell me what we've learned ♪</i>

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.172
<i>♪ I know it sounds absurd ♪</i>

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:12.333
[electronic beep]

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:15.033
Call. Son.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:17.404
-[electronic beep]
-[female voice] <i>Calling son.</i>

00:01:17.488 --> 00:01:19.103
[phone rings]

00:01:21.605 --> 00:01:23.232
[phone rings]

00:01:25.729 --> 00:01:27.474
[phone rings]

00:01:29.932 --> 00:01:31.594
[phone rings]

00:01:33.982 --> 00:01:35.702
[phone rings]

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:39.140
[disconnect tone]

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:44.378
["The Logical Song" by Supertramp playing]